From ebeed4543afe33b672d299ad626b63f25c2200a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NVR <rkwastavich@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:12:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] NVR extension: record compute work into DXVK's D3D9 command
 stream (ID3D9NvrExt)

New COM interface on the D3D9 device (own files d3d9_nvr_ext*.{h,cpp}):
compute pipelines from SPIR-V, D3D9 textures/surfaces bound as sampled or
storage images, own buffers and samplers, push constants, Dispatch, buffer
copies and a test-only readback. Everything goes through EmitCs, so DXVK
orders it with the D3D9 work and handles layouts and barriers.

DXVK files touched: d3d9_device.{h,cpp} (member, friend, QueryInterface),
src/d3d9/meson.build (source + version header), dxvk_context.h (push data
state snapshot/restore, since graphics and compute share it).
